  "request": "Goal: make senti flow set issue-log target a specific active flow using --expect-run-id, --expect-issue, and --expect-spec. Scope: parse and enforce these target guards for issue-log writes, preserve existing single-flow behavior, and add focused coverage for matching and mismatching targets. Out of scope: changing issue-log contents, other flow set commands, or #466 acceptance-review behavior. The command must reject a target mismatch and write only to the selected flow when multiple worktree flows are active.",
